{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b5f3dc69-f151-8c79-b7ee-c292c7a4b5aa",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T13:35:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilza Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:31:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:31:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Nilza Semedo. I am calling about... [pause] my victualler license. For the food. I have to renew it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:31:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. A victualler license renewal. Is this for a business here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Here, at my house. 466 Washington Street. In the Point. I make the food there, and, um, I sell it. Every year it is the same, and every year I have to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Let me just pull that up. Did you want to ask something about the renewal itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I want to know, did the form change this year? Last year they changed the paper, and I filled the old one, and then they sent it back to me. [pause] That was a waste of my morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Let me look at what we have on the counter and online. Give me a moment, I'm a little slow on this screen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is okay. I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:32:18-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. [pause] Okay, so the renewal application is there. I can't say it's identical to last year's, I don't have last year's in front of me. But the one we're handing out now is dated for this license year. If you get the current one from us, you'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So if I use my old one from last year, no good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, I'd say don't use the old one. Get the current one so nobody sends it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:32:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Okay. Because I already have the old one filled, I did it last night. [pause] Now I do it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know, that's annoying. If you like, I can email it to you, or you can pick one up at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:33:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Email is... [pause] I do not know. My phone, it is hard to print from the phone. I come to City Hall. Is okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:33:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. We're open until the end of the afternoon today, and the counter is on the first floor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the fee. What is the fee? Is it the same? [pause] I do not remember what I paid. Something, and then the, the inspection, maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:33:44-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fee should be printed right on the renewal form, so you'll see it when you pick it up. I don't want to quote you a number from memory and have it be wrong. If there's an inspection part, that may be handled by a different office, so the form should say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So you do not know the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not off the top of my head, no. But it'll be on the form, and whoever's at the counter can go over it with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:34:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It is just, every year, a little different. A little more. [pause] I lose the thread. What was I... yes. The form. So I come today, I take the new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the plan. Ask for the victualler renewal. And bring your current license with you, that helps us find your record fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:34:45-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it on the wall in the kitchen. I take it down. [pause] I have been doing this a long time. I came to Rhode Island for a job, many years ago, and I stayed. I did not plan it. And now I have the kitchen and the license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:35:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a good way to end up. Newport's lucky to have you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Maybe. [pause] But the paper, it should not change every year. That is all I say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll make a note that folks get confused by that. Is there anything else I can look up for you while I have your record open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think... [pause] No. The form, the fee. That is what I want. I go today after I put on my coat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:35:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good, Ms. Semedo. Drive safe, there might be some ice in the shady spots."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:35:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T13:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye now."
    }
  ],
